# Code owners for the Bob Skills Marketplace registry.
#
# Rule: a vendor's pack folder is owned by that vendor's maintainers, and
# nothing else. Marketplace administrators own the shared files (vendors.json,
# schemas, CI, CLI). Every pack release needs two approvals: one vendor
# maintainer and one marketplace administrator (branch protection rule).
#
# The marketplace team maintains the IBM vendor folder and curates its packs
# from official IBM repositories.

